@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+These private tarballs are exact unpublished test inputs. The package lock uses these relative files to make the migration candidate reproducible before npm publication. They are not published packages and must not be published as-is. Replace these lock entries with separately approved and independently verified npm artifacts before site adoption.
